Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">稀宇科技开源视频大模型MiniMax H3，明确限制美欧英韩用户使用</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软测试首款自研全双工AI语音模型MAI Realtime，支持16种语言听说并行</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">四川证监局处罚AI造假炒股案：95后利用AI批量编造虚假信息获利被罚48.5万</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">高德升级世界模型ABot-World-0，实现全球首个24小时连续稳定推理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3f007fa8cb6d9457ce4078887637c736.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">高德宣布自研通用交互式世界模型ABot-World-0完成技术升级，在单张消费级GPU上实现连续24小时稳定推理，成为全球首个将交互式世界模型连续推理时长从分钟级提升至天级的模型。针对自回归视频生成中误差累积导致的画面崩坏与物理失真难题，高德提出LongForcing长程训练范式，通过将长时间稳定性与开放场景动态建模纳入训练目标，有效缓解了分布漂移。目前，ABot-World-0已正式开源，支持单张消费级显卡本地部署，并集成至ABot-World Studio开发平台。此次技术突破解决了长时交互中的一致性挑战，显著提升了世界模型在仿真模拟、机器人训练及数字孪生等领域的应用潜力，为交互式世界模型实现长期自主运行提供了关键技术路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果起诉OpenAI窃密案揭露内部数据管理漏洞，前员工离职后仍可访问机密</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97cf32890bed12ea8b3a96c0d7d593b6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果起诉OpenAI窃取商业机密一案引发关注，该案件暴露了苹果内部数据管理存在严重漏洞。由于苹果长期鼓励员工将个人Apple ID与公司配发的iCloud空间绑定，并允许合并2TB存储空间，导致大量工作文件与个人数据混存。由于iPhone仅支持单一主Apple ID进行完整iCloud访问，许多员工将工作与生活文件存储在同一账户中。尽管苹果曾推出“Apple Work”文件夹试图隔离数据，但未被纳入该文件夹的内部资料在员工离职后仍会同步至个人账户。这一架构缺陷使得前员工在离职后，仍能通过个人iCloud设备随时调阅包括产品发布计划在内的机密文件。此事件不仅为苹果与OpenAI的法律诉讼增添了技术争议，也直接揭示了苹果在企业数据治理与账户权限管理方面的软肋，对行业内企业如何平衡员工便利性与数据安全性提出了严峻挑战</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">稀宇科技开源视频大模型MiniMax H3，明确限制美欧英韩用户使用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9abdfe9eeff39f5692cc055327d0e05b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">稀宇科技正式开源视频大模型MiniMax H3，该模型性能对标字节跳动Seedance，但其开源许可协议明确将美国、欧盟、英国及韩国用户排除在外。针对外界质疑，稀宇科技开发者关系负责人Ryan Lee回应称，此举旨在应对公司与好莱坞电影巨头（包括迪士尼、环球影业、华纳兄弟探索）之间的生成式视频版权诉讼。此前，好莱坞巨头指控MiniMax旗下海螺AI未经授权使用受版权保护内容训练模型，美国法院已于今年5月驳回MiniMax的撤诉申请。目前，受限地区用户若需部署H3，必须正式申请授权，并承诺建立符合美国法律与监管要求的内容合规机制。此次限制并非基于地缘政治，而是稀宇科技为规避大洋彼岸法律风险所采取的防御性合规策略，旨在通过许可条款明确界限，防止版权诉讼风险进一步扩大。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软测试首款自研全双工AI语音模型MAI Realtime，支持16种语言听说并行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a8cb3954d53f5c6bc15b7ed65231d1e2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软正在测试其首款原生实时语音模型MAI Realtime，该模型通过全双工交互技术打破了传统语音助手“轮次交替”的限制，实现听说并行。MAI Realtime支持中文、英语、日语等16种语言，具备自动语言检测与中途切换能力，用户无需等待模型输出即可随时插话。相比此前的MAI-Voice-2和MAI-Transcribe-1.5单向任务模型，MAI Realtime在端点检测技术加持下，能即时调整输出以响应用户。目前测试版提供Victoria和Grant两种语音风格，音质较Copilot现有模式更自然，但暂不支持唱歌或生成非语音音效。该模型目前仅在MAI Playground平台向部分合作伙伴开放测试，微软尚未公布其集成至Copilot或上线Microsoft Foundry的具体时间表。此举标志着微软AI语音</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">四川证监局处罚AI造假炒股案：95后利用AI批量编造虚假信息获利被罚48.5万</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/57b0b6d2b1dccf8512d08a2ee295b20f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">四川证监局于8月3日公布行政处罚决定书，投资者孙某因利用AI工具批量编造并传播虚假信息操纵期货市场，被没收违法所得8.5万元并处罚款40万元，合计罚没48.5万元。2023年11月，孙某通过百度百家号“帝侃”，在两天内利用AI工具连续发布17篇关于某上市公司纯碱生产锅炉故障的虚假文章，并同步进行纯碱期货合约交易。尽管相关上市公司已发出律师函要求停止侵权，但孙某仍通过误导性信息获利。监管部门认定，孙某未经核实编造传播虚假信息，主观故意明显，破坏了期货市场正常信息传播秩序，违反了《期货和衍生品法》。此案是公开报道中罕见的AI造假操纵期货市场处罚案例，明确了监管机构对利用AI技术降低造谣成本、扰乱金融市场行为的严厉打击态度，警示行业参与者AI工具的使用必须符合法律法规红线。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
